Subject: [PATCH 24/27] Treasure Trails: searches on closed drawers/chests, two
 more easy map interfaces

Search steps whose loc only opens target the open variant's Search (<loc>open, <loc>_open,
closed->open; the Edgeville coffin completes on Open). Map rows 2232 (Brother Galahad's house) =
trail_map09 and 2234 (north of Falador) = trail_clue_easy_map006, identified by rendering the
interface models; rows 2260/2261 are X Marks the Spot rows with no easy scroll.
